  "description": "An order's totals, which the server, the web cashier and the Android cashier all compute: the subtotal is the lines' price \u00d7 qty; the discount comes off it; the service charge is service_bps / 10000 of what is left, and the tax tax_bps / 10000 of that plus the service, each rounded to the nearest rupiah, half up; the total adds them up. Amounts are whole rupiah.",
